  > "Administrative Distance is a measure of the trustworthiness of the source of the routing
  >  information.  The lower the AD value, the more reliable the routing protocol is
  >  considered."   (Connected 0, Static 1, ... OSPF 110.)

  4a. DEFAULT INTERFACE COST, read before changing it (21:46:26):
